Z||000014||Ken Wittlief||06-21-2001||09:40 AM||||I dont think that is a gap on the nose, in the front shot it looks like a 1" rubber gasket or weather stripping, and it looks like it sticks up above the surface of the car!?<P>  Isnt Clarion the stereo you get at Kmart or Sams Club?<P>  the interior is pretty nice. but what happend to the rear trunk?! it looks like its only about 8" deep now.<P>  looks like someone took a good shot at doing a kitbashing to a GT, hey who knows, maybe it was some kid that put it together. There is a guy here that completely restored a '69 mustang, and he is almost completely blind - he had to do all the work holding a bigass magnifying glass in one hand to see what he was doing - but his car came out really great - too bad he cant see well enough to drive it.<P>   this car, maybe its the jpegs, but there is something about the way it sits, it doesnt look right - like when you prop a dead person up in chair and glue their eyes open, it only takes a quick glance to tell something isnt right there, but its hard to explain exactly what it is.<P>  maybe someone could go over the whole car and whip it into shape - didnt see much on the drive train or suspension - if someone had the gumption to do the car over, it might not be a bad deal for 3 or $4k||||reg||1
